      "/keys",
      "API Keys manager (list/flag/deactivate/ledger)",
      "/keys [subcommand]",
      "Manage your API keys.\n  /keys                - View API keys status and call counts.\n  /keys deactivate <hash> - Permanently deactivate a key.\n  /keys flag <hash> <flag> [note] - Flag a key (e.g. leaked, paid).\n  /keys unflag <hash> <flag> - Remove a flag.\n  /keys ledger         - View full persistent key ledger.",
      10
    ],
    [
      "keys.note.01",
      "keys",
      "note",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "Keys are loaded from your secure env file (GEMINI_KEY_*, OPENROUTER_KEY_*) into per-provider registries under config/.",
      10
    ],
    [
      "keys.note.02",
      "keys",
      "note",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "A key flagged bad, revoked or leaked stays out of rotation even if it is still in the env file; un-flag it explicitly with /keys unflag.",
      20
    ],
    [
      "keys.note.03",
      "keys",
      "note",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "Key commands take a key hash (shown by /keys), never the raw key.",
      30
